{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf5kawkNy44phYXGjV68U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The build succeeded and all tests passed. Let me verify the implementation details by reviewing the changes:\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** ✓ — `./mvnw test` completed successfully with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. **Existing tests pass** ✓ — All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass (confirmed by 9 total tests)\n3. **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint created and persists** ✓ — Test \"confirms a CREATED shipment to CONFIRMED\" verifies the endpoint creates a response with status CONFIRMED and the repository saves it\n4. **Error responses consistent with rest of API** ✓ — Uses `ResourceNotFoundException` for 404 (SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND) and `ConflictException` for 409 (SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM), following the same pattern as create endpoint\n5. **Repeated confirm succeeds, cancelled rejected (409), unknown id rejected (404)** ✓ — All three cases have dedicated tests:\n   - Idempotency: \"idempotently confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment\" \n   - CANCELLED rejection: \"rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409\"\n   - Unknown ID: \"reports unknown shipment on confirm\"\n6. **No new Maven dependency** ✓ — Only modified Kotlin source files, no pom.xml changes\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** ✓ — Only modified three files, all directly required for the feature\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM` to ErrorCode enum. This is necessary because a new error case (cannot confirm CANCELLED shipment) requires a new error code to be part of the API contract.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added `confirm()` endpoint with:\n   - `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` annotation for correct HTTP method and path\n   - Throws `ResourceNotFoundException` for non-exist